-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
THIRD-PARTY NOTICES
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The web app in index.html is modelled on, and reuses code from,
contour-drawing by TLausZ: https://github.com/TLausZ/contour-drawing

Reused essentially verbatim, translated from German comments to English:
the mask panel (ellipse / rectangle / lasso shapes, their pointer handlers and
the geometric line clipper), the paper/ink CSS palette and page layout, the
declarative slider + help-popover pattern, the split-divider comparison view,
the paper-size table, and the trick of building the worker from a Blob of two
inline <script> tags so the page also runs from file://.

The engraving algorithm itself, the Python CLI, and the JavaScript core and
worker that implement it are independent work.

